  nqHelpNodes[1].textContent='Play, Pause, Rewind, Forward and the seconds slider move only the private lesson timeline. Rewind reviews the illustration; it does not reverse physical flow. Static arrows always show the intended route direction. Markers are not a measured flow rate or travel time.';
  nqHelpNodes[3].textContent='Overview shows four expanded functional passages. Follow flow highlights one circuit; Fit path frames it. Plate / fin detail examines the sheets and corrugations. Labels and display options are reversible. Receiving equipment is intentionally represented only by labelled pipe continuations.';
  nqHelpNodes[4].textContent='Space plays/pauses. Left/Right review one lesson second. Home resets the view; F focuses selection. Escape closes help, then the trainer. Text and form controls keep their own keyboard behavior.';
  nqHelpNodes[5].textContent='T / P / states takes a timestamped read-only simulator snapshot. Exchanger cooling/pressure loss and valve letdown are separate. No missing reading is made zero. Internal layers and phase symbols are schematic; there is no installed layer map, hydraulic solution or phase-fraction calculation. Unit info and Sources retain the exact-owner evidence and unresolved channel conflicts.';
