INFO.cf3d_field_review_12gq={"t":"Manual valves / instruments - second-pass inventory and shape research (12GQ)","d":["Only the 12GP/12GQ source-labelled field-device registry is rendered. Legacy manual/meter/transmitter constructors and four old tower transmitter glyphs with their five orphan lead runs are removed. HMI sensors, trends, process calculations and protection remain unchanged.","Source hierarchy: provided P&ID/HMI defines the tag and process service; published OEM examples guide illustrative hardware morphology; simulator coordinates are schematic and NOT registered NWD coordinates.","Installed field devices: 52. The actual rendered count and skipped/deferred items are available in CF3DFieldAudit. This is not a complete facility inventory.","Manual devices have open red handwheels and exposed yokes/stems, no diaphragm/solenoid/powered actuator. Control, shutdown and PSV shapes from prior passes are preserved, including photographed blue PV-1010A.","New transmitter housings distinguish pressure connections from thermowell/temperature heads. Two-tap DP meter examples and technology-neutral meter spools are separately identified in the device records.","Pending normal positions, valve numbers, model numbers, sensor ranges and P&ID grids are not invented. Read-only model graphics are not field maintenance/LOTO instructions.","NWD(10) SHA-256 b27d2fc23b1667aca998990d5b6e2f994622dca79bc91078ef8814f60f8581d4 matches prior upload. Individual geometry transforms remain unregistered; no exact placement is inferred from NWD catalogue strings.","Research accessed 2026-10-03.","Deferred: FT-1421A on the short A-valve inlet run and the previously deferred LCV-1421A upstream manual block remain unrendered; do not overlap another fitting to force placement.","Manual valve shape: https://velan.com/products/api-600-cast-steel-gate-valves/ | Open handwheel, non-rotating exposed stem, bolted bonnet; generic morphology only.","Pressure transmitter shape: https://www.emerson.com/en/measurement-instrumentation/products/rosemount-3051-pressure-transmitter-family | Sensor body/electronics housing and process/manifold connections; no assigned model.","Instrument manifold shape: https://www.emerson.com/en/measurement-instrumentation/products/rosemount-305-instrument-manifold-family | Separate process isolation/manifold interface; no field lineup inferred.","Temperature transmitter shape: https://www.emerson.com/en/measurement-instrumentation/products/rosemount-3144p-temperature-transmitter-family | Distinct temperature electronics head; actual thermowell/direct/remote arrangement needs field source.","DP meter shape: https://www.emerson.com/en/measurement-instrumentation/products/rosemount-3051sfc-orifice-plate-flow-meter | Flat primary-element carrier with separate DP transmitter; illustration only where technology not identified.","ESD / control distinction: https://www.rotork.com/en/products/heavy-duty-fluid-actuators/gpgh/gpgh | Rotary actuator families support on/off AND modulating duties. Functional tags determine the category; geometry alone is not proof."]};
