 if(mode==='operator_brief'&&!q.trim())q='Give me a concise operator brief for the current screen/system: what matters now, top likely cause if abnormal, fastest proof tag/trend, immediate safe checks, consequence and confidence.';
 if(mode==='forecast'&&!q.trim())q='Predict the cause-and-effect response of the current plant to the operator change described in the question. Use immediate, short, medium and downstream horizons and name confirming tags.';
 if(mode==='health_profile'&&!q.trim())q='Build an equipment health profile for the current equipment/system using live state, peer comparison and 10m/3h/24h/72h trends. Separate process upset from equipment degradation. Return a visible final answer with findings, confidence, and fastest proof checks.';
 if(mode==='maintenance'&&!q.trim())q='Perform predictive-maintenance review of the current equipment/system. Use trend persistence, peer divergence, differential conditions, temperatures, oil behavior, run state and source-backed limits. Classify WATCH / PLAN INSPECTION / ACTION only with evidence. Return a visible final answer.';
