INFO.drain_flare_audit_12iw={t:'12IW - Plantwide cold-drain / closed-drain / flare continuity audit',d:[
 'BUILD-SNAPSHOT GEOMETRY CHECK, NOT FIELD CERTIFICATION. All'+CF_DRAIN_AUDIT_12IW.counts.registeredRoutes+' registered routes screened;'+CF_DRAIN_AUDIT_12IW.counts.serviceCandidateRoutes+' drain/relief/flare source-record candidates. Every PSV outlet checked independently.',
 CF_DRAIN_AUDIT_12IW.counts.psvResults.MODEL_PATH_FOUND+' PSV outlet model paths reach their expected receiver service. Known unresolved source/model boundaries and the missing methanol-pump PSV remain listed; unknown destinations are not guessed.',
 'Cold drain1084 ->V-1650 ->separate vapor1085; closed drainDH ->V-8100; flareRF/FL ->established arrival/V-8110. Process thermal returns and625 refrigerant return remain separate.',
 'M2560 PSV-5900A1189 is connected to flare arrival. M2200 PSV-1443 now returns to625 ABOVE7011 ->E-1241 upper refrigerant shell, not V-1441 or any drain/flare header.',
 'Future M2560 suction/discharge provisions retain drawn caps. Small unassigned bleeds remain visibly TERMINAL PENDING.',
 'Every result describes the static build geometry, not current valve position, available relief protection, lineups, gravity drainage, no-pocket compliance or backpressure.'
 ].concat(CF_DRAIN_AUDIT_12IW.psvOutlets.map(function(r){return r.tag+' | '+r.expectedService+' | '+r.status+' | '+r.sourceDestination;}),CF_DRAIN_AUDIT_12IW.limits)};
